## 7. System Architecture (Phase 1)

### Universal Crawl Pipeline

#### Step 1: Fetch
- Load project page HTML
- Public pages only
- Respect robots.txt

#### Step 2: Normalize
Convert page into a unified schema:

```json
{
  "project_title": "",
  "agency": "",
  "portal_type": "",
  "bid_due_at": "",
  "job_walk": {
    "exists": true/false,
    "mandatory": true/false,
    "details": ""
  },
  "eligibility": {
    "restricted": true/false,
    "notes": ""
  },
  "documents": {
    "visible": true/false,
    "accessible": true/false
  },
  "scope_text": ""
}
Step 3: LLM Semantic Pass
Extract narrative requirements

Detect job walk language

Identify disqualifiers

Flag uncertainty explicitly (no guessing)

